    "# Feature Engineering and Feature Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "Feature Engineering is the process of creating new variables (features) that help a machine learning model better understand patterns in the data.\n",
    "\n",
    "Feature Selection is the process of choosing only the most useful variables while removing redundant or irrelevant ones.\n",
    "\n",
    "**The goal is to:**\n",
    "- improve prediction accuracy\n",
    "- reduce overfitting\n",
    "- reduce computational cost\n",
    "- make the model easier to interpret\n",
    "\n",
    "Create useful features for the machine learning models while avoiding target leakage. We evaluate features using:\n",
    "- Correlation analysis\n",
    "- Mutual Information\n",
    "- ANOVA F-Test (classification)\n",
    "- Feature Importance (Random Forest)\n",
    "- Simple engineered features"
   ]
